{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04086","headline":"饯赵尚书摄御史大夫赴朔方军 · 苏頲","name":"饯赵尚书摄御史大夫赴朔方军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劲虏欲南窥，扬兵护朔陲。\n赵尧宁易印，邓禹即分麾。\n野饯廻三杰，军谋用六奇。\n云边愁出塞，日下怆临岐。\n拔劒行人舞，挥戈战马驰。\n明年麟阁上，充国画於斯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04086.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04086","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}